amples, textures, overdraw. Maybe 100 bytes per pixel? 124M*100=12.4 GB/s. Still low vs 500 GB/s. Need make limited: maybe 1000 bytes per pixel? 124 GB/s, still below 500. Need numbers where memory bandwidth is bottleneck. Could use compute: 100 TFLOPS, each pixel needs 1000 FLOPs? 124M*1000=124 GFLOP/s, far below 100 TFLOP. Not limited. Need choose workload where memory traffic high: ray tracing? Or simple: GPU can do 100,000 operations per second? No.\n\nNeed made-up but", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0007198659004643559], [760, -7.988202095031738]], [[1144, -2.5987963454099372e-05], [1902, -11.12717342376709]], [[310, -0.6470169425010681], [4087, -0.8032077550888062]], [[5707, -0.7321434020996094], [4087, -0.7810764312744141]], [[310, -0.07780160754919052], [303, -2.650151252746582]], [[1156, -2.396135460003279e-05], [6163, -11.018132209777832]], [[25, -0.016423726454377174], [303, -4.187972545623779]], [[328, -0.279472291469574], [10033, -1.9234657287597656]], [[814, -8.261545008281246e-05], [2523, -9.799338340759277]], [[20139, -1.2517053619376384e-05], [10083, -11.782546043395996]], [[310, -0.00019331654766574502], [2423, -8.71430492401123]], [[264, -0.00013459633919410408], [21520, -9.171402931213379]], [[21520, -0.00027463631704449654], [2754, -9.549936294555664]], [[1496, -1.4424427718040533e-05], [4962, -12.767976760864258]], [[33541, -0.0002053590869763866], [54087, -9.405341148376465]], [[5286, -3.695556370075792e-05], [26578, -10.791720390319824]], [[11, -8.356920443475246e-05], [1076, -9.545305252075195]], [[303, -0.00011265912326052785], [883, -9.374809265136719]], [[883, -1.4662849935120903e-05], [264, -12.718177795410156]], [[220, -4.267783515388146e-05], [19, -11.11152458190918]], [[19, -5.4480129620060325e-05], [18, -9.985787391662598]], [[15, -8.344653679159819e-07], [19, -14.332833290100098]], [[15, -5.960466182841628e-07], [21966, -15.002333641052246]], [[4105, -5.841272468387615e-06], [3299, -12.755687713623047]], [[11, -0.00020237824355717748], [20564